# CODEOWNERS — enforces review from the listed owners on every PR to main.
#
# Replace the placeholder handles with your real GitHub (or GHE) usernames / teams. GitHub does
# NOT count a PR author's own review, so keep at least two owners: the author is then always
# reviewed by one of the others.
#
# Enforcement requires branch protection to have "Require review from Code Owners" enabled
# (see docs/ci/branch-protection.md) — this file alone does not block merges.

* @your-handle @your-teammate

# Narrower ownership for CI/CD, architecture and process docs — kept explicit so these areas can
# be handed to a different owner later without touching the default rule.
/.github/ @your-handle @your-teammate
/docs/ci/ @your-handle @your-teammate
/docs/adr/ @your-handle @your-teammate
